{"articleNo":"2571","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2571&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010-2학기 그린에너지 수상 장려금 신청 안내 (학부생)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.07.21","hit":"12392","attachments":[{"name":"장학금신청서(수상장려금).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2571&attachNo=1648"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br>2010년도 2학기 그린에너지 수상 장려금 신청 안내 (학부생)</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 신청대상 : 그린에너지 참여학생(학부생)</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2. 장학금액 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">상(200만원), 중(100만원), 하(50만원)로 평가 및 지급</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">3. 신청기간 : 수시접수</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">4. 신청방법 : 제출서류를 구비하여 학생과로 제출 (글로벌관 458호)</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">5. 선발조건 : <font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><u>태양광 또는 수소 연료전지 관련한 작품으로</u></font> 공모전 또는 경진대회에서 수상 실적이 우수할 경우 지급</font></span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">6. 제출서류</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 장학금 신청서</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 본인 또는 학부모 통장사본</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 상장</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 대회 관련 자료</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;5) 작품제출 증빙 보고서(자유양식)</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">7. 중복수혜원칙 : 모든 장학금을 합하여 등록금 범위 내에서 중복 가능</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: medium\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2010. 07. 21<br><br>학생과장<br><br></span></span></strong></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
